WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.170
Hi, welcome back to the online retreat,

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:23.160
the Wheel of Life, and I'm happy to have Allison Zhou translating today. Thank you.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:32.180
Session twelve, the name we chose is called, "misunderstanding how I met my teacher."

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:42.160
We're going to be doing a meditation.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.840
We are going to explore

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:49.980
the dependent origination of my teacher

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:55.720
and the emptiness of my teacher.

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.900
So, what does that mean?

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:03.240
In the meditation,

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:08.240
we're going to picture our teacher in front of us.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:14.980
You know, we've been picturing the teacher knee-to-knee,

00:01:19.119 --> 00:01:24.869
but for this meditation I'm going to ask you to put your teacher up a little bit higher, which is traditional.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:34.152
Like they're sitting on a teaching throne,

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:36.040
they start about here.

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:43.760
We're going to think about

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:46.220
"how did I meet this teacher?"

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:53.260
Then we're going to explore emptiness

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:55.940
and dependent origination.

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:58.060
So let's start.

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:00.060
By the way,

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.320
the picture here

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:05.060
is a dinner.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:08.180
This is called Thanksgiving dinner;

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:14.529
it's traditionally a very important holiday in America.

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:21.460
We have a dinner with the people we love and we thank them.

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:27.920
Let's start the meditation.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.000
So please get comfortable.

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:40.480
If you're not comfortable at the beginning of the meditation,

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:41.900
I guarantee you,

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:45.220
you will be uncomfortable during the meditation.

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:54.300
If you're super comfortable at the beginning of the meditation,

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:01.440
you will only be a little bit uncomfortable during the meditation.

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:07.720
Okay, let's start. Close your eyes.

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:12.759
Nice, small, gentle smile.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:18.820
The eyelids are closed softly.

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.320
Please come to your breath ...

00:03:28.550 --> 00:03:30.969
we'll do the normal ten breaths--

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:36.500
it helps to stop the busy mind

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.530
and start the meditation mind.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.280
Here we go.

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:48.100
Long exhales.

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:51.300
At the end of the exhale,

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:52.280
please breathe out a little bit extra.

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:58.460
Here we go.

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.640
Now picture your teacher in front of you.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:23.200
They are sitting on a teaching throne--

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:28.140
the place where their body meets the throne

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:30.820
is about the height of your chest.

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:45.760
Take a few moments,

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:48.160
get the picture clear in your mind--

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.300
it's a real person.

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:57.840
Now I'd like you to think back,

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:04.640
how did you first meet that teacher

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:08.380
in this life?

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:15.420
I'll describe my own case;

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:18.920
I first saw that teacher

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.680
at a Thanksgiving dinner

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:29.600
at my mother's house

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:33.100
and she was invited to come to my mother's house.

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:41.600
If you ask me how did she come there?

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:46.240
I can clearly imagine--

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:50.800
I can still remember the color of the car,

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.295
what kind of car,

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:01.040
I can remember the teacher getting out of the car.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.220
I can imagine

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:11.140
the car driving across the streets to my mother's house.

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:19.756
I know what those streets look like--

00:08:19.756 --> 00:08:21.400
I can imagine those streets.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:30.800
I know the home where my teacher was living.

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.560
Later I visited that home.

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:41.180
If you ask me,

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:45.560
how did you meet your teacher the first time?

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:51.560
I can remember my mother

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:56.040
cooking the Thanksgiving meal.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:01.040
I actually remember I was working on a car--

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:03.340
I was fixing a car.

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:08.900
I remember

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:11.040
the teacher driving up in their car.

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:17.100
In my mind,

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:19.820
I have a clear picture of how they got in the car,

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.640
how they came,

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.040
drove in the car across the streets to my house.

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:36.300
So now look at this teacher again.

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:41.300
I want you to

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:43.300
try to remember 

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:45.660
how did you first meet this teacher?

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:51.900
Where were you?

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:56.140
What was the first few minutes like?

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:01.120
Can you imagine how the teacher got to that place?

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:08.040
Do you remember how you got to that place?

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:13.740
Let's spend a few minutes,

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:17.000
thinking about

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:22.500
"how was it that I first met my teacher?"

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:27.760
Try to make as much detail as you can ...

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:29.860
some of it, you have to guess.

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:23.220
Now please come back to the present moment.

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:28.500
"That teacher is sitting on a teaching throne

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:30.620
in front of me."

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:36.260
Now I'd like to have some fun.

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:38.986
Move that teacher a little bit off to the side

00:12:38.986 --> 00:12:40.720
on the throne.

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.710
Now bring a second teacher

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:50.860
who looks just like the first one.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.540
Now it's kind of fun because

00:12:57.700 --> 00:13:00.000
on the teaching throne there is enough room 

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.180
for two copies 

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:05.710
of my teacher to sit comfortably next to each other.

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:20.200
Now I'm going to ask you again:

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:28.020
how did you first meet this new copy of your teacher?

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:40.420
Now you're going to use your third eye to check about the answer to this question.

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:50.580
And we're going to think about real dependence.

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:58.300
If I use my third eye, which is the eye of wisdom--it's not a real eye, okay.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:04.860
The eye of wisdom

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:07.080
when it's a baby,

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:10.820
it's a kind of logic--what's logical.

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:19.920
When that third eye gets stronger and grows up,

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:23.340
it becomes a direct perception of the past.

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:33.498
So let's open up the third eye

00:14:33.498 --> 00:14:35.100
in the middle of our forehead.

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:42.380
Let's look at this second teacher,

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:45.400
the copy of my teacher.

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:49.380
Where did this teacher come from?

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:55.780
How did they come to the place where I first met them,

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:58.180
like the Thanksgiving dinner?

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:05.960
Well, that's now a different question!

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:12.060
Maybe in a past life,

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:18.780
I was taught something about these topics,

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:21.140
like the Wheel of Life.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.280
I learned it pretty well.

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:31.060
I studied it, I listened to the video,

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:34.449
I watched everything and I read the books

00:15:34.449 --> 00:15:36.940
and I got to know it pretty well.

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:46.660
Then I met a friend of mine

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:49.620
and they asked me,

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:53.180
"Could you teach me a little bit about the Wheel of Life?"

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:57.940
And I did.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:15:59.620
I shared what I understood.

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:03.460
I know it wasn't perfect and I didn't understand everything

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:06.460
but I shared what I could with a good heart.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.307
Each time I taught them

00:16:16.307 --> 00:16:19.660
a single word of the ideas of the Wheel of Life,

00:16:25.140 --> 00:16:27.140
I planted good seeds in my mind.

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:32.240
Then maybe I died,

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:39.860
I went to the bardo (BAR DO) and I was a golden color.

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:45.020
And then I was born

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:49.380
into my mother's womb in this life.

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:57.000
And then I grew up in my home.

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:01.060
One day,

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.460
the seeds in my mind

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:09.020
from sharing the Wheel of Life in my past life,

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:13.860
one-by-one,

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:16.060
suddenly in succession,

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:18.280
one after another,

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:22.960
those seeds opened

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:28.100
and I saw my teacher getting out of a car,

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:31.260
because the seeds opened to see that.

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:38.740
Then the seeds open to a picture

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:43.240
of my lama coming into my house.

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:49.340
Then the seeds opened for me

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:52.400
to first see my lama and first talk to them.

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:59.260
So now if you ask me,

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:03.860
how did you really meet them?

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:12.600
My seeds created the house where they used to live.

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:21.900
Then my seeds created the roads in the city which came to my mother's house.

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:31.692
My seeds created a car

00:18:31.692 --> 00:18:36.420
which drove from her house to my mom's house.

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:43.540
Then my seeds created

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:46.860
the kitchen and the dining room next to the kitchen.

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:54.960
Then my seeds opened

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:57.880
into this beautiful person.

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:04.440
Ever since then,

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:09.520
65 times per second,

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:15.239
those many good seeds from sharing the Wheel of Life,

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:24.750
have been opening into this teacher who is with me now.

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:31.920
So now if you ask me

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:34.440
"Where did this second teacher come from?"

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:41.220
They drove from the past life

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:45.340
in the car of dependent origination

00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:47.120
from the day I shared

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:50.260
my understanding of the Wheel of Life.

00:20:00.179 --> 00:20:01.242
Now if I tell you,

00:20:01.242 --> 00:20:03.483
you have to choose one of these teachers,

00:20:03.483 --> 00:20:04.548
who is the real one?

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:12.805
Is the real teacher that first one who came in the car along the road

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:14.580
and walked into your mom's house?

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:24.140
Or is the real teacher the one who came to you 

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:28.280
because you taught someone the Wheel of Life in your past life?

00:20:34.889 --> 00:20:38.089
"Oh, now I understand that's the real one."

00:20:41.279 --> 00:20:45.079
That's actually the dependent origination teacher.

00:20:48.179 --> 00:20:50.179
Well, who is the other teacher?

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:54.260
The teacher that I met because someone built a road,

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:56.960
and someone built a house, and someone built another house,

00:20:57.420 --> 00:20:59.000
and someone made a dinner.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:10.120
Nice translation, thank you.

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:15.740
"Oh, now I realized that's not the real teacher."

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:19.640
Does it look like a teacher?

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:21.380
Yeah,

00:21:22.560 --> 00:21:24.240
that's why we call it apparent teacher--

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:27.660
looks like a teacher, deceptive teacher.

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:35.460
"But now I understand--that's not the real teacher."

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:43.110
That's the person who seems like the real teacher but not the real teacher.

00:21:47.380 --> 00:21:49.380
I suggest we cancel that teacher.

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:57.000
Let's let the dependent origination teacher sit on the throne.

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:04.060
And that other teacher can disappear,

00:22:05.740 --> 00:22:08.380
into thin air, just disappear.

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:14.700
Because they are empty.

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:17.980
They don't exist

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:19.800
and they never existed.

00:22:21.020 --> 00:22:23.020
It was never true

00:22:24.980 --> 00:22:27.740
that that was my real teacher.

00:22:30.240 --> 00:22:31.740
It felt like that,

00:22:32.700 --> 00:22:34.300
but I was wrong.

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:37.160
Let's cancel that teacher.

00:22:38.680 --> 00:22:42.060
Then we come to the emptiness of the wrong teacher.

00:22:46.720 --> 00:22:51.240
The state of mind that thought that was where my teacher came from--

00:22:51.540 --> 00:22:52.360
those roads--

00:23:00.100 --> 00:23:04.340
that's link number one in the Wheel of Life--

00:23:04.340 --> 00:23:05.320
the blind man--

00:23:05.700 --> 00:23:07.040
misunderstanding.

00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:17.660
The teacher that misunderstanding thinks is the real teacher

00:23:18.060 --> 00:23:20.620
doesn't exist at all.

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:21.540
And that is emptiness.

00:23:26.820 --> 00:23:30.200
Yeah, the state of mind

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:36.460
that believed the teacher drove to my house across those roads--

00:23:42.320 --> 00:23:45.140
that state of mind was misunderstanding.

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:48.540
That state of mind is link number one.

00:23:50.120 --> 00:23:52.270
That state of mind will get me in trouble.

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:58.620
So now we understand link number one--

00:24:00.060 --> 00:24:02.480
misunderstanding.

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:06.180
We understand it about our teacher

00:24:08.680 --> 00:24:11.600
and where our teacher really came from.

00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:16.800
And again as we learned in the other meditation

00:24:16.940 --> 00:24:19.340
this teacher is coming from me.

00:24:23.620 --> 00:24:25.940
Let's stop misunderstanding

00:24:26.060 --> 00:24:28.520
how I met my teacher the first time.

00:24:33.980 --> 00:24:36.909
This is a very great meditation to do,

00:24:39.950 --> 00:24:44.020
because if you find out really why you met your teacher the first time,

00:24:48.940 --> 00:24:50.800
then you can keep your teacher

00:24:52.160 --> 00:24:54.680
and you will never lose your teacher,

00:24:57.640 --> 00:25:02.480
because you understand that your teacher is coming from the seeds that you plant,

00:25:02.809 --> 00:25:06.129
when you teach someone else the best you can.

00:25:12.740 --> 00:25:16.360
So let's finish the meditation.

00:25:17.460 --> 00:25:20.240
Enjoy this real teacher

00:25:22.640 --> 00:25:24.760
sitting in front of you.

00:25:25.380 --> 00:25:28.340
Enjoy understanding where they really came from.

00:25:31.860 --> 00:25:36.440
Enjoy knowing that you can keep them with you now.

00:25:40.360 --> 00:25:42.360
Just keep planting the seeds,

00:25:44.480 --> 00:25:46.820
share what you understand

00:25:46.860 --> 00:25:47.920
as well as you can.

00:25:48.120 --> 00:25:51.240
Nobody teaches perfectly, but the best you can.

00:26:12.720 --> 00:26:15.920
Let's give away the good karma in a golden light.

00:26:27.880 --> 00:26:29.880
Smile.

00:26:30.850 --> 00:26:32.850
Take a good stretch.

00:26:33.850 --> 00:26:35.630
Thank you for translating.

00:26:35.630 --> 00:26:37.980
Okay. See you in the next session.

